    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like music? Are you tired of annoying scooter riders? Scooter Slayer is a musical racing rhythm arcade that turns your or built-in songs into a unique track, the shape of which, like the speed of your car, will depend on the selected song. Enjoy the speed performed with synthwave/retrowave style to your favorite tracks and make the roads cleaner! The game has statistics for each song, there are also Steam achievements.</p>",
